<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 18.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 18.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>International prices for milling and Durum wheat were weaker as aggressive export sales by Argentina pressured prices, the Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said. Wheat indicator prices for multi-grade contracts 1996/97 fell A$3.00 while Durum fell A$2.00.</p>
<p>Prices, FOB, in A$ per tonne:</p>
<p>		    ASW 10 pct		   No 1 DURUM</p>
<p>		    Delivered Port	     Delivered Port</p>
